Submission/WeSuite/Bigger-Data/README.md
This document provides a high-level overview of the AI-Hackathon repository, explaining its purpose, primary systems, and architecture. The repository consists of three main AI-powered systems that address different business needs through various AI technologies.

For specific details about the repository structure, see Repository Structure.

Purpose
The repository contains three specialized AI systems:

DB Image Generator - A Spring Boot application that generates product catalog images using OpenAI's image generation capabilities
WeSuite Bigger-Data - A document search and retrieval system using Elasticsearch and LLMs
TTG Document Generation - A document template generation system with AI integration
These systems demonstrate different applications of AI technologies to solve business problems related to content generation, document search, and templating.

