Key Systems Overview
DB Image Generator
A Spring Boot application that generates product catalog images using AI. This system is the most extensively documented component in the repository.

Technical Stack:

Spring Boot 3.4.2
Spring AI 1.0.0-M5 (OpenAI integration)
Spring Cloud (Eureka for service discovery)
Cloud Foundry deployment environment
Key Features:

AI image generation based on category and prompt
Integration with DB Commerce catalog service
Microservice architecture with service discovery
For more detailed information about this system, see DB Image Generator System.

Sources: 
Submission/DB/pom.xml
11-15
 
Submission/DB/README.md
