WeSuite Bigger-Data (WeAssist)
An LLM-driven document search system that enables efficient retrieval of relevant document chunks using semantic search and keyword matching.

Technical Stack:

Elasticsearch for vector and full-text search
Hugging Face Transformers/Sentence-Transformers for embeddings
Ollama for local LLM deployment
Python and Streamlit for application interface
Key Features:

Hybrid search combining BM25 keyword search and vector similarity
Document chunking and embedding generation
Interactive chat interface with document context
For more detailed information about this system, see WeSuite Bigger-Data System.

Sources: 
Submission/WeSuite/Bigger-Data/README.md
1-18

TTG Document Generation
A document generation system that creates document templates with AI assistance and can deliver them via email.

Technical Stack:

AI wrapper architecture for provider abstraction
Integration with Gemini and OpenAI
Email delivery service
Business entity integration
Key Features:

Document template generation
AI-powered content creation
Email document delivery
For more detailed information about this system, see TTG Document Generation System.

Technical Component Mapping
The following table shows the mapping between business concepts and their corresponding code implementations:

Business Concept	Implementation Component	System
Catalog Image Generation	DBImageGenerator	DB Image Generator
Document Search	WeAssist + Elasticsearch	WeSuite Bigger-Data
AI Content Generation	AIWrapperFactory	TTG Document Generation
LLM Query Processing	Ollama Integration	WeSuite Bigger-Data
Email Delivery	FluentEmail	TTG Document Generation
