Development and Deployment
The repository includes configuration for different deployment environments:

Development: Configuration in manifest-dev.yml for Cloud Foundry deployment
Production: Configuration in manifest-prod.yml for Cloud Foundry deployment
The DB Image Generator system, in particular, requires specific environment variables for operation, including OpenAI API credentials provided through service bindings in Cloud Foundry.

